      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='UTF-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0'><title>Self-Loop Bottleneck</title><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;background:#0a0a1a;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:20px;min-height:100vh}.title{font-size:1.5em;font-weight:300;color:#a0c4ff;margin-bottom:5px}.subtitle{font-size:.85em;color:#888;margin-bottom:25px}.comparison{display:flex;gap:40px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:30px}.card{background:#16163a;border-radius:16px;padding:25px;width:320px;text-align:center}.card h3{font-weight:400;margin-bottom:15px;font-size:1.1em}.card.perfect h3{color:#ff6b6b}.card.imperfect h3{color:#51cf66}.loop-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;margin:15px auto;max-width:240px}.loop{width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.75em;font-weight:600;transition:all .3s;cursor:default;margin:0 auto}.loop.active{transform:scale(1);opacity:1}.loop.forbidden{opacity:.15;transform:scale(.8)}.loop.perfect-active{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff6b6b,#cc4444);box-shadow:0 0 15px rgba(255,107,107,.3)}.loop.perfect-forbidden{background:#332222;border:1px dashed #552222}.loop.imperfect-active{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#51cf66,#339944);box-shadow:0 0 15px rgba(81,207,102,.3)}.big-number{font-size:4em;font-weight:200;margin:10px 0}.card.perfect .big-number{color:#ff6b6b}.card.imperfect .big-number{color:#51cf66}.ratio-bar{margin-top:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.bar-container{width:500px;height:40px;background:#1a1a3a;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;display:flex}.bar-perfect{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff6b6b,#cc4444);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:600;font-size:.9em;transition:width 1s}.bar-imperfect{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#51cf66,#339944);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:600;font-size:.9em;flex:1}.explanation{max-width:600px;margin-top:25px;padding:20px;background:#16163a;border-radius:12px;font-size:.9em;line-height:1.6;color:#aaa}.explanation strong{color:#e0e0e0}.explanation em{color:#a0c4ff;font-style:normal}</style></head><body><div class='title'>The Perfect Consonance Bottleneck</div><div class='subtitle'>Why parallel fifths and octaves are forbidden: a 12:1 self-loop ratio</div><div class='comparison'><div class='card perfect'><h3>Perfect Consonance (e.g., P5)</h3><div class='big-number'>1</div><p>self-loop (identity only)</p><div class='loop-grid' id='perfect-grid'></div></div><div class='card imperfect'><h3>Imperfect Consonance (e.g., M3)</h3><div class='big-number'>12</div><p>self-loops (all motions)</p><div class='loop-grid' id='imperfect-grid'></div></div></div><div class='ratio-bar'><span style='color:#888'>Incoming edges:</span><div class='bar-container'><div class='bar-perfect' style='width:45.9%'>Perfect: 61</div><div class='bar-imperfect'>Imperfect: 72</div></div></div><div class='explanation'><p>A <em>self-loop</em> is a voice leading where both voices move but maintain the same interval. For a <strong>perfect consonance</strong> like the fifth, self-loops require parallel motion — both voices moving by the same amount. But the fundamental rule of counterpoint forbids parallel motion into perfect consonances. So only the <strong>identity</strong> (no motion at all) survives.</p><p style='margin-top:10px'>For an <strong>imperfect consonance</strong> like the major third, parallel motion is unrestricted. All 12 possible parallel motions (one for each semitone amount) are legal self-loops.</p><p style='margin-top:10px'>This <em>12:1 ratio</em> is the categorical manifestation of the centuries-old prohibition on parallel fifths and octaves. Perfect consonances are \"sticky\" — you can stay on them only by holding still.</p></div><script>const pgrid=document.getElementById('perfect-grid');const igrid=document.getElementById('imperfect-grid');for(let b=0;b<12;b++){const d1=document.createElement('div');d1.className=b===0?'loop active perfect-active':'loop forbidden perfect-forbidden';d1.textContent=b===0?'id':'×';d1.title=b===0?'Identity (0,0) — permitted':`Parallel (${b},${b}) — FORBIDDEN`;pgrid.appendChild(d1);const d2=document.createElement('div');d2.className='loop active imperfect-active';d2.textContent=b;d2.title=`Parallel (${b},${b}) — permitted`;igrid.appendChild(d2);}</script></body></html>"
